  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Dangerous Over Short Distances" id="fa84-af1e-096b-0f33" hidden="false">
      <description>Due to their low mobility, Squats must roll 3d6 and choose the lowest two results when chasing, advancing or retreating.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Exo-Armour" id="ab31-e90f-dae3-6887" hidden="false">
      <description>A model with exo-armor has a saving throw of 2+ and its attacks are increased by 1. Troops equipped with exo-armor can be teleported to the battlefield so they can use the Deep Strike rules but only if the mission allows it. In addition, the troops with exo-armor that win a hand-to-hand combat will only be able to consolidate their position.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
