    <selectionEntryGroup name="Wargear" id="c831-731b-805e-41cc" collapsible="true" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true">
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry name="Auspex" id="b953-bb80-4aad-b3f5" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="176d-2e8f-6358-828f" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="2"/>
          </costs>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Auspex" id="440c-0967-1912-3728" hidden="false">
              <description>If enemy infiltrators set up within 4D6&quot; of a model with a auspex, then that model and the unit they are attached to is allowed to take a &quot;free&quot; shot at them. These shots are taken before the battle begins and may cause the infiltrators to fall back.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="Bionics" id="3dd7-8869-ce5b-a202" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="6e2a-9908-c9fb-bc19" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="10"/>
          </costs>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Bionics" id="c843-5520-375d-c545" hidden="false">
              <description>When a model with bionics is killed, instead place it on its side. Roll a D6 at the start of the next turn: on a roll of 6 the model stands back up with 1 wound, but on any other roll it is removed as a casualty.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="Frag Grenades" id="7273-30d2-8ddc-af93" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
